( 4. e3 { [%name 4.e3? Lasker Trap] }
  4... Bb4+ { The check sets up the trap. }
  5. Bd2 dxe3 6. Bxb4 exf2+ 7. Ke2 fxg1=N+ { Underpromotion to a knight with check! }
